DeepTutor Mobile
Copyright 2026 DeepTutor Mobile contributors

An independent third-party mobile client for HKUDS/DeepTutor.
Not an official HKUDS release and not endorsed by the upstream maintainers.
Upstream: https://github.com/HKUDS/DeepTutor
First supported API contract: v1.7.1, commit f7aed0744c36c5afef16a4261c31ebee1208cac2.
Upstream DeepTutor is licensed under Apache License 2.0.
This repository does not bundle its Python server or web frontend.
The embedded modules load from the user's own DeepTutor deployment.

The client UI was adapted from an Expo mobile prototype,
then modified to remove deployment-specific configuration and add per-service
session isolation. No private repository history or learning data is included.

Dependency attribution is recorded in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md and
 docs/dependency-licenses.json. Keep applicable third-party notices when
redistributing dependencies or built applications.
